    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yesu yaakoba Abeegeresebwa be ati: “Ebisendasenda abantu okugwa mu kibi byakubaagho, aye akagwireku oyo abireeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo kyandimubeereire kikalamu ngoli asibibwa olubengo olunene mu nkoto n'asuulibwa mu nhandha, okusinga okuleetera ni bw'aba omulala ku bato bano okugwa mu kibi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kale mwekuume, muganda wo bw'akukolanga ekibi, omunenianga era bwe yeenenianga omusonighanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.18.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 18:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era bw'akukolanga ebibi emikuzi musanvu olunaku olulala, era n'airanga y'oli emikuzi egyo omusanvu n'akukoba ati, ‘Tikairayo,’ omusonighanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatume baakoba Musengwa bati: “Twongereku okwikiriza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa yaabakoba ati: “Nguli mulikuuku n'okwikiriza okwaga n'akamuuma ka kaladaali, mwandisoboire okukoba omuti ogw'enkenene guno muti, ‘Va ghano weesimbe mu nhandha’ gwabawulira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naani ku imwe aba n'omugheereza we alima oba ayaya, n'amukoba nga yaakava mu nimiro ati, ‘Idha otyame tulye?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tamukoba bukobe ati, ‘Ntegekera kye nnaalya era ovaale bukalamu ompeereze okutuusa bwe nnaamala okulya n'okunhwa, memale weena olye era onhwe?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'amala yeebaza omugheereza oyo olw'okukola by'amulagiire? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale mwena bwe mukolanga ebyo byonabyona ebibalagirwa mukobanga muti ‘Tuli bagheereza abazira kye tugasa, tukoze bw'ekyo kye tuteekwa okukola.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwatuuka bwe yali aja e Yerusalemu, yaabita ghagati gha Galilaaya ni Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe yali aja okungira mu kabuga, yaayagaanana n'ab'endwaire ey'ebigenge ikumi, era baayemerera nga ghakaabulayo akata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baaleekaana bati: “Yesu Musengwa, tusaasire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu bwe yababona yaabakoba ati: “Muje mweyandhule ye bakabona.” Era bwe baali baja baalongooka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.14.1+LEV.14.2+LEV.14.3+LEV.14.4+LEV.14.5+LEV.14.6+LEV.14.7+LEV.14.8+LEV.14.9+LEV.14.10+LEV.14.11+LEV.14.12+LEV.14.13+LEV.14.14+LEV.14.15+LEV.14.16+LEV.14.17+LEV.14.18+LEV.14.19+LEV.14.20+LEV.14.21+LEV.14.22+LEV.14.23+LEV.14.24+LEV.14.25+LEV.14.26+LEV.14.27+LEV.14.28+LEV.14.29+LEV.14.30+LEV.14.31+LEV.14.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 14:1-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omulala ku abo bwe yabona ng'awonie, yaira einhuma okusaaka Katonda ng'ayogerera ghaigulu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "era yaatuuka yeeyala ku itaka agho gha bigere bya Yesu nga yeeyanza. Era ono yali Musamaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yesu yaakoba ati: “Abawonie tibabaire ikumi? Memale omwenda bali gha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tighabaire aira kugha Katonda kitiisa okutoolaku ono ow'eighanga erindi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale n'okumukoba ati: “Situka oje okwikiriza kwo kukuwoniiza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafarisaayo baamubuuza bati: “Obwakyabazinga bwa Katonda butuuka li?” Yaabairamu ati: “Obwakyabazinga bwa Katonda tibuja kwidha na bumanhiso ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "era abantu tibalikoba bati, ‘Bona eno, buubuno’ oba bati, ‘Buubule!’ Kuba Obwakyabazinga bwa Katonda buli mu imwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho yaakoba Abeegeresebwa be ati: “Ekiseera kiri kwidha mwe mulyegombera okubona Omwana w'Omuntu waire olunaku olulala luti, aye nga timusobola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghalibaagho ababakoba bati, ‘Wuule ghale’ oba bati, ‘Wuuno ghano.’ Aye mutajangayo waire okubanonereza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba ng'olukuba bwe lughemya ni lumulisa ghansi gh'eigulu woonawoona okuva ku luuyi olundi okutuuka ku lundi, atyo n'Omwana w'Omuntu bw'aliba ku lunaku lwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ateekwa okusooka okudaazibwa einho, n'okwegaanibwa ab'oluse luno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga bwe kyali mu nnaku dha Noa era bwe kiriba ni mu nnaku edh'Omwana w'Omuntu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.6.5+GEN.6.6+GEN.6.7+GEN.6.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mainh 6:5-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
