              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baali bali ku kulya, kunhwa, kubayiza, na kubayira, okutuusa ku lunaku Noa lwe yangira mu lyato, amaadhi ag'omwidhuzo gaidha gabazikiriza boonaboona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
